WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.133
Revision improves content, paragraph organisation and clarity; proofreading corrects

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:07.325
grammar, punctuation and spelling.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:13.427
Which revision removes repetition? Answer: The pupils planted trees and watered them.

00:00:14.283 --> 00:00:19.295
Exchange two paragraphs with a partner, revise their ideas and proofread the final

00:00:19.295 --> 00:00:19.681
version.

00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:24.416
Why it works: Concise wording avoids unnecessary repetition.
